{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"codex-relics","chapterId":"item-ItemConfigRelic-33145","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"codex-relics-item-ItemConfigRelic-33145-item-ItemConfigRelic-33145-0","text":"位面封装的是被一刀斩开过去未来的出云。出云曾遍历不堪言状的生存战争，也曾有过饫甘餍肥的辉煌岁月…如今荒土业已无处可寻，唯余下埋葬往昔的剑冢。","speaker":""}]}
